      <VERS vnumber="67">And they <gr str="5414">gave </gr>to them, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">of</STYLE> the <gr str="5892">cities </gr>of <gr str="4733">refuge</gr>, <gr str="7927">Shechem </gr>in <gr str="2022">mount </gr>
